## 4. Recommended Patterns (Best Practices)

### PATTERN #1: Modular Test Architecture

- Split large test suites into focused files (<1000 lines each)
- Use shared helper modules for common operations
- Organize by testing phase or functionality

### PATTERN #2: Comprehensive Logging

```javascript
console.log(`[${TEST_NAME}] Operation: ${operation}`);
console.log(`[${TEST_NAME}] Result:`, JSON.stringify(result, null, 2));
console.log(`[${TEST_NAME}] Intelligence Score: ${score}`);
```

### PATTERN #3: Concurrent Testing

- Always test with 3+ concurrent users for production readiness
- Validate system behavior under load
- Use Promise.allSettled for robust concurrent operations

