### During Implementation Checklist
```markdown
- [ ] Using real AI services (not mocked)
- [ ] Profile validation implemented
- [ ] Error classification in place
- [ ] Intelligence validation included
- [ ] Appropriate timeouts set
```

### Post-Implementation Checklist
```markdown
- [ ] All Critical Rules validated
- [ ] Test logs analyzed for false positives
- [ ] Intelligence scores documented
- [ ] No configuration bugs masked as success
- [ ] Concurrent testing performed
```

### Test Suite Completion Gate
```markdown
Before marking ANY AI integration test suite complete:
1. [ ] Run validation helper on all results
2. [ ] Document intelligence scores achieved
3. [ ] Verify no configuration bugs passed
4. [ ] Confirm real API calls occurred
5. [ ] Sign-off: "This test suite follows all Critical and Mandatory rules"
